## Background and Motivation

<!--
We welcome API proposals! We have a process to evaluate the value and shape of new API. There is an overview of our process [here](https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/main/docs/APIReviewProcess.md). This template will help us gather the information we need to start the review process.
First, please describe the purpose and value of the new API here.
-->
Need virtual method `CheckSlidingExpiration` in CookieAuthenticationEvents, when its needs to be overridden in different class

https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/c911002ab43b7b989ed67090f2a48d9073d5118d/src/Security/Authentication/Cookies/src/CookieAuthenticationEvents.cs#L21-L24

## Proposed API
```diff
namespace Microsoft.AspNetCore.Authentication.Cookies;

public class CookieAuthenticationEvents
{
    public Func<CookieSlidingExpirationContext, Task> OnCheckSlidingExpiration { get; set; } = context => Task.CompletedTask;

+   public virtual Task CheckSlidingExpiration(CookieSlidingExpirationContext context) => OnCheckSlidingExpiration(context);
}
```


## Usage Examples

``` c#
public class CustomCookieAuthenticationEvents : CookieAuthenticationEvents
{
    ...
    public override Task CheckSlidingExpiration(CookieSlidingExpirationContext context)
    {
        // Update in Db that cookie has been refreshed
        // Or update in Db, that cookie was intentionally not refreshed as user Authenticated using SSO
    }
    ...
}
```

## Alternative Designs

``` c#
options.Events = new CookieAuthenticationEvents()
    {
        OnCheckSlidingExpiration = cookieSlidingExpirationContext => // This already exists
        {
            return Task.CompletedTask;
        }
    };
```

## Risks

_To be evaluated, it's an extension of existing cookie refresh functionality_

